    initial_prompt = """I've implemented a package dependency resolver with backtracking. Here are the two universes:

Universe A:
- app 1 requires: lib [1..3], util [3..3]
- lib 3 requires: core [3..3]
- lib 2 requires: core [1..2]
- lib 1 requires: (nothing)
- util 3 requires: core [1..1]
- core 3, 2, 1 require: (nothing)

Universe B:
